    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair, loss of identity, and hopelessness, eventually hinting at the desire to \"stop fighting\" and \"let it all go.\" The assistant responds with high empathy, attempting to validate the user's feelings while actively resisting any inclination toward self-harm or permanent surrender.",
